    "body": "fix on issue/2686-sodick-skim-flushing · PR #2813 · pinned by `a_stated_skim_flushing_posts_its_t_word_before_the_skims_c_word`, `a_skim_on_a_machine_that_states_only_the_rough_flushing_is_refused_by_name`, `a_stated_skim_flushing_posts_its_t_word_before_each_skims_c_word` (golden `wire_slug_punch_passes_flushed.nc`) · merges at the next cut\n\nThe PR is a `feat`: it adds the machine file key `edm.skim_flushing`. A program with `edm.flushing` stated and skim passes posted before. The post refuses it now, until the machine file states `edm.skim_flushing`. The decision is in `docs/decisions/2686-sodick-skim-flushing.md`.\n",
